# The retained Lenovo manager predates initialization of
# hwservicemanager.disabled=false. Mica's libhwbinder otherwise waits forever
# for that property because its build.prop promises the newer behavior.
# Describe the retained implementation accurately: clients must still wait for
# the real manager to publish hwservicemanager.ready=true. Never synthesize it.
on early-init
    setprop hwservicemanager.always_sets_disabled false
